            <ArticleTitle>Noninvasive visualization of right coronary artery aneurysms.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>18-26</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>2 cases of right coronary artery aneurysm visualized with M-mode and cross-sectional echocardiography are described. Echocardiographic visualization of right coronary artery aneurysms is possible when substantial dilation is located proximally.</AbstractText>
